# Read automatically by `vite build` — no need to set this by hand before
# deploying. This is exactly what caused a real outage on 2026-09-21: a
# manual rebuild used VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.internez.eu (missing
# /api), which broke every single API call, not just one. See
# frontend/src/api/client.ts for how this gets used.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.internez.eu/api
